      <shape width="640" height="96" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="172" type="text" id="bxf">
        <content textType="title" fontSize="56" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
          <p>学智有机</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="760" height="40" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="278" type="text" id="bxl">
        <content textType="headline" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(232, 237, 247, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>面向高中有机化学的可验证教学智能体</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="720" height="64" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="340" type="text" id="bxe">
        <content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(154, 167, 189, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
          <p>让学生问出的每一个化学结论，都能追溯到讲义依据与分子结构证据，并直接看到三维结构与反应过程。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bxB" startX="80" startY="452" endX="880.0006249997559" endY="452">
        <border color="rgba(42, 53, 80, 1)" width="1"/>
      </line>
      <shape width="360" height="24" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bxH">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(154, 167, 189, 1)">
          <p>团队【待填】　｜　2026 年 11 月</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="360" height="24" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="470" type="text" id="bxo">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(154, 167, 189, 1)" textAlign="right">
          <p>本地原型已跑通前后端链路 · AgentArts 平台侧为迁移设计</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
    </data>
    <note id="bxx">
      <content>
        <p>各位评委好，我们的作品叫学智有机，是一个面向高中有机化学的可验证教学智能体。它解决的核心问题是：传统工具给得出结论，却给不出依据和微观过程。今天的介绍会区分两类内容——本地原型已经跑通的能力，以及按华为云 AgentArts 能力做的平台迁移设计。</p>
      </content>
    </note>
  </slide>
  <slide id="pCV">
    <style>
      <fill id="fCV">
        <fillColor color="rgba(242, 244, 248, 1)"/>
      </fill>
    </style>
    <data>
      <shape width="800" height="40" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="52" type="text" id="bxu">
        <content textType="title" fontSize="28" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(13, 19, 38, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>结论给得出，依据和过程给不出</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="800" height="28" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="100" type="text" id="bxh">
        <content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>高中有机化学的难点不在记住结论，而在理解「为什么」——为什么这样断键、为什么性质不同、为什么同分异构。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bxg" startX="80" startY="176" endX="112.01562118716424" endY="176">
        <border color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)"/>
      </line>
      <shape width="240" height="24" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="190" type="text" id="bxw">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>01　高中生（复习 / 预习）</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="240" height="120" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="224" type="text" id="bxa">
        <content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(46, 50, 56, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
          <p>看得懂答案，想不通过程；分子式在脑中只是平面符号，难以建立空间想象与反应图景。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bxc" startX="350" startY="176" endX="382.01562118716424" endY="176">
        <border color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)"/>
      </line>
      <shape width="240" height="24" topLeftX="350" topLeftY="190" type="text" id="bxK">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>02　一线化学教师</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="240" height="120" topLeftX="350" topLeftY="224" type="text" id="bxj">
        <content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(46, 50, 56, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
          <p>重复答疑量大；想给学生展示断键成键的微观过程，手头缺少可复用、可演示的工具。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bxr" startX="620" startY="176" endX="652.0156211871642" endY="176">
        <border color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)"/>
      </line>
      <shape width="260" height="24" topLeftX="620" topLeftY="190" type="text" id="bxS">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>03　教辅 / 课程制作方</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="260" height="120" topLeftX="620" topLeftY="224" type="text" id="bxM">
        <content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(46, 50, 56, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
          <p>答案与结构素材生产流程长，结构和讲解质量难以统一，知识口径也不易逐条复核。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bxm" startX="80" startY="372" endX="880.0006249997559" endY="372">
        <border color="rgba(216, 222, 232, 1)" width="1"/>
      </line>
      <shape width="300" height="24" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="392" type="text" id="bxE">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>现有方案各占一环，缺少把四件事收敛到同一会话的智能体</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="240" height="64" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="428" type="text" id="bxD">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p><strong>通用大模型聊天</strong>：能回答结论，来源不稳定，分子结构与事实不受校验。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="240" height="64" topLeftX="350" topLeftY="428" type="text" id="bxW">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p><strong>搜题 / 题库 App</strong>：多为教辅答案，静态配图，不呈现反应过程。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="260" height="64" topLeftX="620" topLeftY="428" type="text" id="bxX">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p><strong>分子查看器</strong>：能旋转看结构，但不检索知识、不组织讲解与判分。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
    </data>
    <note id="bxC">
      <content>
        <p>这一页先讲清楚痛点来自三类真实用户：学生卡在过程想象，教师卡在重复答疑和演示工具，教辅方卡在素材生产质量。下面一行是我们对现有方案的判断——大模型、题库、分子查看器各自只覆盖一环，没有一个把可信检索、确定性计算、过程可视化和讲解组织在同一条链路里。</p>
      </content>
    </note>
  </slide>
  <slide id="pCj">
    <style>
      <fill id="fCj">
        <fillColor color="rgba(242, 244, 248, 1)"/>
      </fill>
    </style>
    <data>
      <shape width="800" height="40" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="52" type="text" id="bel">
        <content textType="title" fontSize="28" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(13, 19, 38, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>检索—解析—可视化—讲解，一条可核验的 Agent 链路</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="400" height="28" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="100" type="text" id="bxR">
        <content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>模型不直接拍脑袋回答，而是按规则调用受限工具集。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="40" height="24" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="150" type="text" id="bex">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>01</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="336" height="26" topLeftX="124" topLeftY="148" type="text" id="beB">
        <content fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(13, 19, 38, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>检索依据</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="336" height="40" topLeftX="124" topLeftY="178" type="text" id="beo">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>从自编讲义检索命中片段，答案附真实来源；检索无命中时如实标注，不伪造引用。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="40" height="24" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="232" type="text" id="bxV">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>02</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="336" height="26" topLeftX="124" topLeftY="230" type="text" id="bxJ">
        <content fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(13, 19, 38, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>解析分子</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="336" height="40" topLeftX="124" topLeftY="260" type="text" id="beQ">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>RDKit 校验 SMILES 合法性，计算分子式、分子量、环数与命中的官能团。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="40" height="24" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="314" type="text" id="bef">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>03</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="336" height="26" topLeftX="124" topLeftY="312" type="text" id="bxI">
        <content fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(13, 19, 38, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>可视化</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="336" height="40" topLeftX="124" topLeftY="342" type="text" id="bxN">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>生成三维结构与断键 / 成键帧序列，支持三视图切换与机理动画播放。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="40" height="24" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="396" type="text" id="bee">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>04</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="336" height="26" topLeftX="124" topLeftY="394" type="text" id="beH">
        <content fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(13, 19, 38, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>讲解输出</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="336" height="40" topLeftX="124" topLeftY="424" type="text" id="bem">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>汇总证据生成讲解文本并配合语音；工具不可用时按降级分支如实说明。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <img id="bxz" src="TbQZb6GbbohsqixzV9dcVEnWnwb" width="380" height="267" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="150">
        <crop type="rect" leftOffset="0" rightOffset="0" topOffset="0.09375" bottomOffset="0.09375"/>
