      <shape width="380" height="24" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="426" type="text" id="bxp">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>原型界面：问答附「依据来源」与部分降级状态（历史基线，讲义内容待化学教师审核）</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
    </data>
    <note id="bet">
      <content>
        <p>作品的主链路分四步：先检索讲义依据，再用 RDKit 解析分子，接着生成三维结构和机理动画，最后汇总证据做讲解并配语音。右侧是本地原型的真实界面，可以看到答案下方挂着依据来源，右上角如实标出部分降级状态。需要强调，检索命中不等于答案已经过教师审核，这一边界我们在材料里一直保留。</p>
      </content>
    </note>
  </slide>
  <slide id="pCy">
    <style>
      <fill id="fCy">
        <fillColor color="rgba(242, 244, 248, 1)"/>
      </fill>
    </style>
    <data>
      <shape width="800" height="40" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="52" type="text" id="bxn">
        <content textType="title" fontSize="28" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(13, 19, 38, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>创意一：把答案可信做成三道硬约束</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="800" height="28" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="100" type="text" id="bxv">
        <content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>不靠提示词祈祷模型不出错，而是在工具层、参数层、事实层分别设闸。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="40" height="24" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="152" type="text" id="bxk">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>闸 1</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="328" height="26" topLeftX="128" topLeftY="150" type="text" id="bxq">
        <content fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(13, 19, 38, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>工具白名单</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="328" height="44" topLeftX="128" topLeftY="180" type="text" id="bxA">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>Agent 只能调用注册过的 4 个受控工具；工具实现来自服务端，不由模型定义或修改。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="40" height="24" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="252" type="text" id="bxs">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>闸 2</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="328" height="26" topLeftX="128" topLeftY="250" type="text" id="bxU">
        <content fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(13, 19, 38, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>结构化参数校验</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="328" height="44" topLeftX="128" topLeftY="280" type="text" id="bxT">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>拒绝未声明字段、缺必填项与类型不符；不执行模型给出的任意表达式，不做 eval。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="40" height="24" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="352" type="text" id="bxb">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>闸 3</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="328" height="26" topLeftX="128" topLeftY="350" type="text" id="bxL">
        <content fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(13, 19, 38, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>RDKit 事实兜底</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="328" height="44" topLeftX="128" topLeftY="380" type="text" id="bxZ">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(83, 97, 116, 1)">
          <p>分子结构与客观属性一律由 RDKit 计算；解析失败如实返回，不编造结构与属性。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="380" height="300" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="150" presetHandlers="0" type="rect" id="bxy">
        <fill>
          <fillColor color="rgba(191, 215, 255, 0.22)"/>
